# v2.6 (ADR-0013): Coins.ph public market data, read paths only. Coins.ph sends no
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin header, so the hosted PWA reaches it through these
# same-origin rewrites. No headers, no secrets. Must match
# apps/confluence/web/src/lib/public-hosts.ts — release check R16.
/x/coinsph/openapi/v1/time            https://api.pro.coins.ph/openapi/v1/time            200
/x/coinsph/openapi/v1/exchangeInfo    https://api.pro.coins.ph/openapi/v1/exchangeInfo    200
/x/coinsph/openapi/quote/v1/*         https://api.pro.coins.ph/openapi/quote/v1/:splat    200

# v2.8 (WP26, ADR-0003 amendment v2.8): Upbit public market data, read paths only. Upbit's
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin header is unreliable (probe EX-PROBE-1,
# docs/research/evidence/wp26-venues-probe-2026-11-15.json), so the hosted PWA reaches it
# through these same-origin rewrites. Its account and order endpoints share the host and
# have no rule here. No headers, no secrets. Must match
# apps/confluence/web/src/lib/public-hosts.ts — release check R16.
/x/upbit/v1/market/all    https://api.upbit.com/v1/market/all    200
/x/upbit/v1/ticker/all    https://api.upbit.com/v1/ticker/all    200
/x/upbit/v1/ticker        https://api.upbit.com/v1/ticker        200
/x/upbit/v1/orderbook     https://api.upbit.com/v1/orderbook     200
/x/upbit/v1/candles/*     https://api.upbit.com/v1/candles/:splat    200

# v2.8 (WP28): the phone app link lands on this hosted page when the app is not installed or the link is not verified;
# the single page app shows it as a foreign callback. Same-origin 200 rewrite, no host, no secrets (not a /x/ rule).
/oauth/app/*  /index.html  200
